    {
      "bbox": [
        268,
        944,
        1467,
        1174
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Committee Established. The Mayor's Committee on Equal Employment Opportunity in City Government (the \"Committee\") is hereby established. The members of the Committee shall include the Deputy Mayor for Operations, who shall serve as Chair, the Corporation Counsel, the Personnel Director and the Chairman of the City Commission on Human Rights.",
