    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        470,
        1375,
        1430,
        1604
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(b) The Committee shall ensure that the City complies with the requirements of Title VII of the Civil Rights Act of 1964, as amended, and other laws prohibiting discrimination in employment by public employers and that the City fulfills its commitment to provide equal employment opportunity.",
