        1638,
        1450,
        1904
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "\u00a73. City Guidelines. Under the direction of the Chair and in consultation with the Mayor's Office of the Handicapped and the Department for the Aging, the Committee shall continue to develop, maintain and update the \"Manual for the Preparation of Agency and Citywide Equal Employment Opportunity Programs\" (the \"Manual\"), which sets forth the standards and procedures for a City Equal Employment Opportunity Program and for agency programs.",
